BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Alger Mitchell at SALTwater Harborside Dining
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260524
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260525
DTSTAMP:20260823T105559Z
UID:56651fdef385ddc5772b8f8d401e@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Alger Mitchell at SALTwater Harborside Dining Sundays from 4:0
 0 to 7:00 PM Alger Mitchell is a dynamic song stylist\, songwriter\, and v
 ocalist\, delivering captivating performances with guitar and harmonica. B
 oasting a remarkable repertoire of approximately 250 songs performed entir
 ely from memory\, Alger's music is 100% live\, free of electronic enhancem
 ents. His versatile setlist spans the timeless classics of The Great Ameri
 can Songbook\, from Broadway to Hollywood\, alongside beloved jazz and pop
  standards\, classic country\, oldies\, and his own original compositions.
  With infectious energy\, his live performances invite optional dancing\, 
 making it nearly impossible to resist moving to the music! Keep a smile on
  your face and a song in your heart!\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisla
 nd.com/event/alger-mitchell-at-saltwater-harborside-dining/110157/
LOCATION:Saltwater at The Newport Harbor Hotel & Marina\, 49 America's Cup
  Avenue\, Newport\, RI 02840 Time: 4:00 PM to 7:00 PM 49 America's Cup Ave
