BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ashley Jordan live at Ballard’s
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260823
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260824
DTSTAMP:20260823T105559Z
UID:64965b53b00af74bad97003d63c3@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Ashley Jordan live at Ballard’s brings powerhouse vocals and
  honest storytelling to Block Island for a show that fits perfectly with a
 n oceanfront summer crowd. From the first song\, Ashley pulls you in with 
 a sound that blends modern country and Americana with a soulful edge\, cre
 ating the kind of set that feels personal\, high energy\, and made for a t
 rue Block Island beach day. Ashley Jordan’s story is as compelling as he
 r music. She started performing as a teenager on Boston street corners and
  grew into an award winning artist known for fearless lyrics and a voice t
 hat can quiet a room and then lift it right back up. Her roots run from Ne
 w England to formative summers in the Ozark Mountains\, and you can hear t
 hat mix of grit and heart in every chorus. Expect a performance that moves
  between crowd favorites\, emotional moments\, and big singalong hooks tha
 t land especially well in an open air beach setting.\n\nSource: https://ww
 w.visitrhodeisland.com/event/ashley-jordan-live-at-ballard%e2%80%99s/11050
 5/
LOCATION:Ballard's Beach Resort\, 42 Water Street\, Block Island\, RI 0280
 7 42 Water Street\, Block Island\, RI 02807 OFFICIAL RHODE ISLAND TRAVEL G
