DESCRIPTION:Music at Sunset: Concert Series 2026 Wednesdays | June 3 &#821
 1\; August 26 Music from 6:00 &#8211\; 8:00 PM\, Parking and Check-in open
  at 5:00 PM Wednesday nights at Blithewold are the perfect way to enjoy su
 mmer with friends and family! Sit down and soak up the summer sun over Nar
 ragansett Bay\, and enjoy a variety of musical performances by local music
 ians. Guests are encouraged to bring picnics\, chairs\, or blankets. Sprea
 d out on our 10-acre lawn\, where you can enjoy the music and gorgeous sun
 set views over the bay. Don’t have time for a picnic? Don’t worry! New
  this year\, local food trucks will be available for your dining pleasure.
  Check the date for that week’s food truck. Seb’s Wood Fire Oven &#821
 1\; steaming-hot pizza fresh from the oven! Red’s Kitchen &#8211\; Famou
 s steak sandwiches and more! Gnarly Vines &#8211\; Farm fresh delicacies! 
 Registration is recommended due to limited parking availability. You will 
 receive an email with your parking pass the day before\; please print and 
 place it on your car dashboard. Passes will be checked upon arrival. Rain 
 dates for some concerts. Ticket (Per-person): Adult Member: $15 Adult Non-
 Member: $20 Child (ages 5-17): $6 Follow links below to register. June Jun
 e 3: Dred Buffalo: An energetic mix of retro and modern rock and roll. Mor
 e about the band Food Truck: Red’s Kitchen June 10: The DMB Project: A D
 ave Matthews Band tribute band. More about the band Food Truck: Seb’s Wo
 od Fire Oven June 17: Turas: An eclectic mix of traditional and current Ir
 ish music. More about the band Food Truck: Gnarly Vines June 24: Magnolia 
 Cajun Band: Traditional Cajun music More about the band Food Truck: Seb’
 s Wood Fire Oven July July 8: Atwater-Donnelly Trio: A unique blend of tra
 ditional American folk music and dance. More about the band Food Truck: Se
 b’s Wood Fire Oven July 15: Bar Fly: Bar Fly is a local Newport cover ba
 nd with a diverse set list. More about the band Food Truck: Seb’s Wood F
 ire Oven July 22 : Bay Swing: Traditional swing\, jazz\, bossa nova\, and 
 the blues More about the band Food Truck: Seb’s Wood Fire Oven July 29: 
 Sunshine Melodies: Reggae msuic More about the band Food Truck: Seb’s Wo
 od Fire Oven August August 5: Ashley Wineland: Country music with a Cowboy
  twist More about the band Food Truck: Red’s Kitchen August 12: Joe Pari
 llo and the New Ensemble: Lively jazz ensemble More about the band Food Tr
 uck: Seb’s Wood Fire Oven August 19: Colby James &amp\; the Ramblers: Or
 iginal rock and roll music that fuses rock\, blues\, and country styles. M
 ore about the band Food Truck: Gnarly Vines August 26: Steve Smith and The
  Nakeds: Ten-piece band delivers rhythm and blues. More about the band Foo
 d Truck: Seb’s Wood Fire Oven\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.co
 m/event/music-at-sunset%3a-concert-series-2026/109486/
LOCATION:Blithewold Mansion\, Gardens & Arboretum\, 101 Ferry Road\, Brist
 ol\, RI 02809
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/music-at-sunset%3a-concert-seri
 es-2026/109486/
